# 止蝕
(pos:名詞)
<explanation>
yue:投資者為咗避免繼續蝕錢，喺價位跌到某個水平就賣出資產嘅做法（量詞：次）
eng:stop-loss; cutting losses
<eg>
yue:今次股災我設咗個止蝕位，唔使蝕得太甘。 (gam1 ci3 gu2 zoi1 ngo5 cit3 zo2 go3 zi2 sik6 wai2, m4 sai2 sik6 dak1 taai3 gam1.)
eng:I set a stop-loss level during this stock market crash, so I wouldn't lose too much.

<eg>
yue:做生意要識得止蝕，唔好死撐。 (zou6 saang1 ji3 jiu3 sik1 dak1 zi2 sik6, m4 hou2 sei2 caang3.)
eng:In business, you need to know when to cut your losses instead of stubbornly holding on. [end of text]


